{"title":"Gold Rapier","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Thak Footman, Werewolf, Gaunt Ogre, Ogre Butcher, The Howling Sirocco +7 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · STR 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Sword</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Warriors</b> start with it. Everyone else can study a <b>Sword tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-man-at-arms\" title=\"Skeleton Man At Arms - dropped it in 1 of 13 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/06e9ed76c917cacb3bdc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Man At Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 60 of 1,184 looted corpses (1/20)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-elemental\" title=\"Dune Elemental - dropped it in 1 of 50 looted corpses (1/50)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/77761b474a7384a1df3e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/50<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - dropped it in 1 of 66 looted corpses (1/66)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/66<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+8 more\">+8 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"The Howling Sirocco - dropped it in 2 of 296 looted corpses (1/148)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Howling Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/148<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 2 of 422 looted corpses (1/211)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/211<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 3 of 850 looted corpses (1/283)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/283<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Alpha Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 359 looted corpses (1/359)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Alpha Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/359<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 1 of 495 looted corpses (1/495)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/495<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 5 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/756)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/756<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 795 looted corpses (1/795)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/795<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-rapier\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=crude\">Crude <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>45</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=good\">Good <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=superior\">Superior <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"gold-rapier\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/a2b1f5a83b47581bc9e1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>5.6–13.1 damage</td><td>-4 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-rapier?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/a2b1f5a83b47581bc9e1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td